{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_APPLICATIONLEVELERRORHANDLING_SECTION_2_P_ACTIVE","src":"manifest","doc":"ApplicationLevelErrorHandling","page":69,"text":"2 P_ACTIVE\n\nP_TERMINATING\nAn event has occurred that initiates the termination of a partition:\n The OS receives PRO_TERMINATEAPPL_RESTART from a\ncall to the Protection Hook.\n A call to TerminateApplication() is made with parameter set\nto RESTART.\nThe OS triggers the OSRestartTask. In that task, all actions\nnecessary for terminating the partition are initiated.\nNote: The OS cannot distinguish between this transition and the\ntransition P_ACTIVE  P_RESTARTING. This distinction needs to\nbe communicated to the OSRestartTask by other means.","caption":"2 P_ACTIVE ","sha":null,"series":[{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_APPLICATIONLEVELERRORHANDLING_SECTION_2_P_ACTIVE","releases":["4.0.3"],"page":69,"hash":"7187b05be5e40152","caption":""},{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_APPLICATIONLEVELERRORHANDLING_SECTION_2_P_ACTIVE","releases":["4.1.3"],"page":69,"hash":"10cbd0a447828b69","caption":""},{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_APPLICATIONLEVELERRORHANDLING_SECTION_2_P_ACTIVE","releases":["4.2.2"],"page":69,"hash":"19cc85cc56cf7fcc","caption":""},{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_APPLICATIONLEVELERRORHANDLING_SECTION_2_P_ACTIVE","releases":["4.3.1"],"page":68,"hash":"b725e6465b7d035e","caption":""},{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_APPLICATIONLEVELERRORHANDLING_SECTION_2_P_ACTIVE","releases":["R19-11"],"page":68,"hash":"dffeefee721c5f66","caption":""},{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_APPLICATIONLEVELERRORHANDLING_SECTION_2_P_ACTIVE","releases":["R20-11"],"page":68,"hash":"877bdb42bebe5a2e","caption":""},{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_APPLICATIONLEVELERRORHANDLING_SECTION_2_P_ACTIVE","releases":["R21-11"],"page":69,"hash":"68c1327c423b27db","caption":""}],"releases":["R19-11","R20-11","R21-11","4.0.3","4.1.3","4.2.2","4.3.1"],"trel":"R21-11","tstat":"section","drop":"R22-11","kind":"snippet","platform":"classic","targets":[{"role":"constitutive","conf":0.95,"rt":"API_IMPLEMENTATION","m":"gemini-3.8-flash","why":"